---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
import WorkSlider from "../../../components/WorkSlider.astro";
---
<Base title="Iris von Arnim" description="Iris von Arnim – Shopware 6 Commerce by Hob by Horse.">
<div class="project-page">
  <div class="hero-img"><img src="/images/Iris-Von-Arnim.jpg-scaled.jpg" alt="Iris von Arnim" width="3000" height="3000" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
  <WorkSlider currentSlug="iris-von-arnim" lang="en" />
  <div class="content">
    <h1>Iris von Arnim</h1>
    <div class="section">
      <h4>Challenge</h4>
      <p>Iris von Arnim stands for Hanseatic elegance and the finest craftsmanship in luxury fashion. The existing online store needed not only a technical modernisation but a complete rethink — a shop that makes the brand's unique quality and style tangible in the digital world while delivering an excellent shopping experience.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="section">
      <h4>Implementation</h4>
      <p>Hob by Horse took over the existing Shopware 6 store of Iris von Arnim and rebuilt it from the ground up — with the goal of making the brand's values tangible at every digital touchpoint.</p>
      <p>The new frontend was designed with exceptional care: generous white space, high-quality product photography, and intuitive navigation create a shopping experience that lives up to the brand's premium standards. Various integrations were also implemented to ensure smooth operation of the online store.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="section">
      <h3>Services</h3>
      <p class="leistungen">Commerce | Shopware 6 | Rebuild & Optimisation | API Integration | Support</p>
    </div>
    <div class="section cta-section">
      <h3>This shop is Hob by Horse!</h3>
      <p>We'd love to advise you personally!</p>
      <a href="/en/contact" class="cta-btn">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
<style>
.project-page{background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;min-height:100vh}
.hero-img{background:#1a1a1a;height:70vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;padding-top:var(--header-height)}
.hero-img img{max-height:60vh;max-width:80%;width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:0 auto}
.content{max-width:800px;margin:0;padding:var(--spacing-4xl) var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-4xl) 40px}
h1{font-size:3rem;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);text-align:left}
.section{margin-bottom:var(--spacing-3xl);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding-top:var(--spacing-xl)}
h4{font-size:var(--font-size-xs);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#EAB308;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-lg)}
h3{font-size:var(--font-size-xl);font-weight:700;color:#00b4d8;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);text-align:left!important}
p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-md);text-align:left!important;max-width:none!important;margin-left:0!important;margin-right:0!important}
.leistungen{font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:0.03em}
.cta-section h3{color:#E7007F}
.cta-btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:var(--spacing-md);padding:var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-2xl);background:#E7007F;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-size-sm);text-decoration:none}
.cta-btn:hover{opacity:0.85}
@media(max-width:768px){h1{font-size:2rem;line-height:1.2}.content{padding-left:var(--spacing-xl)}}
</style>
